From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:09:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 126/151] Status bar: click line ending or indentation to
 change it

The line ending item opens a small menu with Convert to LF and Convert
to CRLF, the same entries as View > Line endings. The indentation item
opens Tab width 2, 4 and 8, as in View > Indentation, and writes the
tab_width setting. Both menus open above the bar and act on the tab of
the focused view.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

